<title>USA: HomeCorp awaits hearing date on suit.</title>
<headline>HomeCorp awaits hearing date on suit.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKFORD, Ill. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>HomeCorp Inc, parent company for HomeBanc fsb, said it is waiting for a hearing date to be set in connection with its suit in the U.S. Court of Federal Claims against the United States for breach of contract.</p>
<p>The case relates to use of supervisory goodwill as capital created when the bank acquired failing institutions in the 1980s.</p>
<p>The court has yet to issue an order of priority for scheduling such hearings, HomeCorp said.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
